# was: 您好，欢迎参观瓦尔恩行星控制设施自助导览。我们热忱欢迎每一位访客。每到一个关键区域，请务必查看我们的显示屏以获取更多信息。祝您参观愉快！
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:462
msgid "\"Hello and welcome to this self-guided tour of the Varn Planetary Control Facility.  We gladly welcome all visitors.  As you arrive at each key area, be sure to check any of our display screens for more information.  Enjoy your tour!\""
msgstr "“你好，欢迎参加这次维兰行星控制设施的自助导览。我们欢迎所有访客。每当你抵达一个关键区域，请务必查看我们的显示屏幕以了解更多信息。祝你游览愉快！”"

# was: 这里是主设备仓储与维修设施。此时您可能已经注意到几个漂浮的机器人。它们既负责维护本设施的关键系统，也负责卫生清洁。若某个单元受损，会被送到这里维修。
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:471
msgid "\"This is the main equipment storage and repair facility.  By now, you may have noticed several floating Drone-bots.  They are responsible both for maintaining the key systems of this facility as well as sanitation.  If a unit becomes damaged, it is brought here to be repaired.\""
msgstr "“这里是主要的设备储藏与维修设施。到了现在，你可能已经注意到好几台漂浮的无人机了。它们既负责维护本设施的关键系统，也负责清洁卫生。若有机器受损，就会被送到这里维修。”"

# was: 对于任何不便我们深表歉意，现请全体人员撤离本设施。请勿惊慌。谢谢。
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:498
msgid "\"We apologize for any inconvenience, but we ask that all personnel evacuate the facility at this time.  Please do not be alarmed.  Thank you.\""
msgstr "“抱歉给您带来任何不便，但我们要求所有人员立即撤离本设施。请不要惊慌。谢谢。”"

# was: 进入行星反应室前，请向任一机器人索要一副护目镜。在运行高峰期，本设施产生的能量足以点亮从太空中可见的强光。请勿直视光源。
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:507
msgid "\"Before entering the Planetary Reaction Chamber, please request a pair of Safety Goggles from one of our Drones.  During peak hours of operation, this facility can generate enough power to produce a light bright enough to be seen from space.  Please avoid looking directly into the light.\""
msgstr "进入行星反应室之前，请向我们任意一台无人机索取一副护目镜。在运行高峰期，本设施可以产生亮度足以从太空中看见的光。请避免直视光源。"

# was: 警报：四层 18 至 96 区环境控制已离线。在另行通知前，仅限机器人进入。
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:516
msgid "\"Alert, environmental controls are offline on Level Four, Sections 18 through 96.  Access restricted to drones until further notice.\""
msgstr "警报：第四层 18 至 96 区的环境控制系统已离线。在另行通知之前，仅限无人机进入。"

# was: \"警告，入侵警报，四层，区。所有机器人前往四层拦截入侵者。反应堆已离线。加密完整度 2.064%。警告，入侵警报，四层……\"
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:525
msgid "\"Warning, intruder alert, Level Four, Section.  All drones proceed to Level Four to intercept intruders.  Reactor is offline.  Encryption integrity at 2.064%.  Warning, intruder alert, Level Four…\""
msgstr "“警告，入侵者警报，第四层，区段。所有无人机前往第四层拦截入侵者。反应器离线。加密完整性 2.064%。警告，入侵者警报，第四层……”"

# was: 激光枪能提供高效精准的远程攻击。使用时，请舒适地握住枪柄，将枪口对准目标，轻轻扣动扳机。若武器走火，切勿直视枪管——交给教官处理问题。绝不要将激光枪对准任何你不想蒸发的东西。
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi.lua:535 assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sci-fi_mmmerge.lua:16
msgid "\"Blaster weapons provide an effective, accurate ranged attack.  To operate the blaster, hold the grip comfortably in your hand, point the barrel at your target, and gently squeeze the trigger.  Should the weapon misfire, do not look into the barrel- give the weapon to an instructor and let them fix the problem.  Never point a blaster at something you do not want to vaporize.\""
msgstr "迷你榴弹枪能提供有效而精准的远程攻击。使用迷你榴弹枪时，请将握把舒适地握在手中，把枪口对准目标，然后轻轻扣动扳机。若武器发生故障，请勿朝枪管内张望——把武器交给教官，让他们来处理问题。绝不要把迷你榴弹枪对准任何你不想气化的东西。"

# was: 这里藏了东西！
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sewer.lua:111 assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sewer.lua:132 assets_dev/worlds/mm6/events/maps/sewer.lua:136
msgid "Something's stashed here!"
